    "id": 587278,
    "title": "IEEE Day at Hijjawi Faculty",
    "description": "<p>The IEEE Student Branch at Yarmouk University is pleased to announce IEEE Day at Hijjawi Faculty, an event dedicated to celebrating the global IEEE community and its contributions to engineering, technology, and innovation.</p>\r\n<p>The event aims to introduce students to IEEE&rsquo;s mission, vision, and professional opportunities, while highlighting the role of student engagement in advancing technical knowledge, collaboration, and professional development. Through engaging activities and interactive experiences, participants will have the opportunity to learn more about IEEE, explore its various initiatives, and connect with the student branch community.</p>\r\n<p>This event reflects IEEE&rsquo;s commitment to fostering innovation, encouraging collaboration, and empowering the next generation of engineers and technology leaders</p>",
