   "attributes": {
    "id": 586017,
    "title": "IEEE GJU SB Officers Kickoff & Training Session",
    "description": "<p>The first IEEE GJU Student Branch Officers Meeting aims to bring together the newly appointed society board members, provide an opportunity for everyone to get to know each other, and introduce them to their roles and responsibilities.</p>\r\n<p>The meeting will include training sessions covering the fundamentals of serving as an IEEE Society board member, along with an introduction to IEEE vTools and its basic features for managing events and activities.</p>\r\n<p>The goal is to help our officers start the year with a clear understanding of their responsibilities and the tools they need to successfully manage their societies.</p>",
