   "type": "events",
   "id": "587318",
   "attributes": {
    "id": 587318,
    "title": "Emerson Library: IEEE TryEngineering book read-along and STEM activity",
    "description": "<div>\r\n<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_ff92b27d6e19b861\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color tutor-markdown-rendering\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\">\r\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Discover Your Passion: Explore Real World Technology Through STEM!</strong></div>\r\nIEEE TryEngineering book read-along - <a href=\"https://tryengineering.org/home/stem-childrens-book-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://tryengineering.org/home/stem-childrens-book-series&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792532541199000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3_LW2U_Yk6L0eKSc2PI-ud\">https://tryengineering.org/<wbr>home/stem-childrens-book-<wbr>series</a><br>\r\n<div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><sup class=\"superscript\"><!----></sup><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----> <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\"> <strong data-path-to-node=\"3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"1\">Hosted By:</strong> Emerson Public Library</span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><sup class=\"superscript\"><!----></sup><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span> <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">This hands-on experience combines literacy and STEM projects to create and explore after school.</span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><sup class=\"superscript\"><!----></sup><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"> Powered by IEEE Try Engineering and the IEEE North Jersey Section, the event will explore real-world technology topics including:</span></div>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0,0\">Artificial Intelligence</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\">Communication Technology</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\">Electric Vehicles</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0,0\">Ocean Engineering</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0,0\">Semiconductors</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0,0\">Signal Power</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Event Details:</strong></div>\r\n<br>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Date:</strong> Monday, November 16, 2026</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Time:</strong> 3:30 PM</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility:</strong> Open to children grades 3-6.</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration:</strong> Registration is required online at www.emersonlibrary.org</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>More information about:</div>\r\n<div><strong><a href=\"https://r1.ieee.org/northjersey/\">IEEE North Jersey Section</a></strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><img src=\"https://events.vtools.ieee.org/vtools_ui/media/display/6351f7cc-a39c-4366-92da-4286d3861b27\"></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><img src=\"https://events.vtools.ieee.org/vtools_ui/media/display/fb2781db-009a-4014-a492-e25bcf242714\"></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
